{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07df4c622c20093dc4b75265a737eb03020544c82bb59d96c08df084a76df072", "ja": "（今日は紬のグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影だ。\nかなり力を入れた撮影になるから、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄紬与写真杂志合作企划的内容。\n这次会是一次非常用心的拍摄，真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4fb7e9c73d7e35c3db8939dce67173b2d6e19c304b6b07b09c1d1c14ad512c43", "ja": "{$P$}、少しよろしいでしょうか。\nあの……。", "zh": "{$P$}，现在方便吗？那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "88e6fe73736150eb3fc9a2faf3714a127148d32ac3c76420c381689dbb12bc5c", "ja": "先程からスタッフのみなさんが、機材を\n木の上に運び込んでいるように見えるのですが……。", "zh": "从刚才开始，工作人员好像一直在把设备搬到树上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fa57bb93f3655cf8b180bbe7aec3a7303f0b6839798470bcd99ff8744d0232d0", "ja": "ん？　その通りだよ。", "zh": "嗯？没错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8ef72ea4b5096664d5245cc85ebc130703f8127280e0e3a3717306d1c5df8b94", "ja": "ま、まさかとは思うのですが……\nこれから、木に登って撮影を？", "zh": "不、不会吧……\n接下来要爬到树上拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c233121f367596237b9fbf13c327538be49ea234687efd940ce8ce6e866b610f", "ja": "おっ、よくわかったな紬。その通りだ！", "zh": "哦，你理解得很快嘛，纺。就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "15ce01b4e81b6da484fc893b6ceec9187a30ed892c0295aedd89d97672a854d2", "ja": "えっ！？　あんなに高い場所で……？　ドラゴンなら\n問題のない高さだと思いますが、私は人間です……。", "zh": "诶！？在那么高的地方……？如果是龙的话，我觉得那种高度当然没问题，可我是人类……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7494b52eac50dd09f01d592c5e9ece4c39e08222697ef0623768685a125c4f5e", "ja": "もちろん、安全対策はバッチリだ！　ただ、ドラゴンの\n凄みを出すなら、この方法が一番って言われてね。", "zh": "当然，安全措施非常万全！只是听说\n想要展现巨龙的威慑感，这个方法是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a04d279a62a243faa9a206a64316355cf5356fd3fc474b5ef5f3313dc08861f6", "ja": "そう、ですね……。\nそのほうが雰囲気は出るかもしれませんが……。", "zh": "是、是这样……  \n这样或许更有气氛，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9bab4d5aa6f752aee09af8660666cca5ac10c338e58b06cc66e619320a846a66", "ja": "紬……？　うーん、やっぱり怖いか？", "zh": "紬……？嗯，果然还是害怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c535794e3f5e3da145eabc39810a8e3e43c7b6d24ac2095427443f7d3cebc63f", "ja": "こ、怖いというわけでは！　本当にあの場所で撮る\n必要があるのか、確認しようと思っただけです！", "zh": "也、也不是害怕！我只是想确认一下，真的有必要在那个地方拍摄吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8699478b50b8805efb2c3f45c63e0aca6838addbbe8a653ffe917f0e8a3bb0c4", "ja": "そ、そうか。でも本気で怖いなら、すぐ言ってくれ。\nCGで合成する方法だって……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。不过你要是真的害怕，就马上告诉我。\n用CG合成也不是不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "24cfa912d691fa5cd8957cdcbeec13210b29ffe0d354d0837c075a8d3ffee32f", "ja": "それはいけません。あのセットにどれだけの労力が\nかかっているのか、わからない私ではありません。", "zh": "那可不行。我不是不知道那套布景倾注了多少心血的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "85a983b32287d20015e328c327a5734e7096d5bc28a6c616cc5b5b36b83cf0d2", "ja": "はっ！　まさか貴方は、私がスタッフさんの努力を\n顧みず、無下にすることができる人間だと……？", "zh": "哈！难道您以为，我是那种不顾工作人员的努力，就能轻易将其弃之不顾的人吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c219856740f4df21af0e6913c87369b99f1dceb846e400067ba58b8fb7368771", "ja": "い、いや、そんな風に思ってないよ。\nそれじゃ、紬。本当にやるんだな？", "zh": "不、不是，我没那么想。\n那么，紬，你真的要做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b16b6c4860c57cd125fa9630a5ef24d7abc6f83e3d49c8d08eb32dd56c59d729", "ja": "問題ありません。今の私は……\n気高く強靭な精神を持つ、ドラゴンなのですから！", "zh": "没问题。现在的我……\n可是拥有高傲且强韧的精神的巨龙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9bb72e049bf7ee658116f3203f00bdfbf87be127cf2b45b03ecf718046758efb", "ja": "わかったよ。もし何かあっても、ちゃんと助けるから。\nだから安心して撮影に挑んでほしい。", "zh": "我知道了。就算真有什么意外，我也会好好帮你的。\n所以希望你能放心地去拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0543_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ce5bc0faf4d2bad93b397803fa50d506d602a394ad4a53089cc18d7914d5c0e7", "ja": "もしもの話だとしても、何かあっては困ります！\nですが……私が困った時はよろしくお願いしますね。", "zh": "就算是假设，真出什么事也是不行的！\n不过……要是我遇到困难的时候，就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
